[CustomMessages]
; ── 英文（不带前缀 = 所有语言的兜底）──────────────────────────────────────
FushiUiFont=Segoe UI Variable Display
FushiStepWizard=Setup
FushiStepProgram=Program location
FushiStepData=Data location
FushiStepPreferences=Preferences
FushiStepReady=Review settings
FushiStepInstalling=Installing
FushiInstallLocationLabel=Install location
FushiTaskGroupFileAssoc=File associations:
FushiTaskVideoAssoc=Add Fushi to "Open with" for video files (mkv / mp4, etc.)
FushiTaskBookAssoc=Add Fushi to "Open with" for book and comic files (epub / pdf / txt / cbz, etc.)
FushiProgIdVideo=Fushi video
FushiProgIdBook=Fushi book
FushiDataRootCaption=Make room for your content
FushiDataRootDescription=Choose where books, manga, covers, subtitles, dictionaries and the database are stored.
FushiDataRootNote1=This data can grow far larger than the program itself, so pick a location with plenty of space.
FushiDataRootNote2=You can move it later in Settings → Data storage location.
FushiDataRootLabel=Data storage location
FushiErrNotWritable=The selected folder cannot be written with the current permissions:
FushiErrWritableHint=Choose a folder your user account can write to (the default %1 is recommended).
FushiErrInstallAdminHint=Installing into a folder that needs administrator rights is not recommended: even if you reinstall there as administrator, Fushi runs with normal rights, so every automatic update would need elevation again.
FushiErrDataRootNotAbsolute=The data storage location must be a full absolute path (for example D:\FushiData).
FushiErrCurrentValue=Current value:
FushiErrDataRootOverlap=The data folder cannot be the same as the installation folder, and neither may contain the other:
FushiErrInstallFolder=Installation folder: %1
FushiErrDataFolder=Data folder: %1
FushiErrSeparateFolderHint=Choose a separate folder (the default %1 is recommended).
FushiErrDataRootReserved=The selected folder already contains a documents or support subfolder:
FushiErrDataRootReservedHint=Fushi creates and takes over these two subfolders inside the data folder. Choose an empty folder or create a new one.
FushiErrDataNotWritable=The selected data folder cannot be written with the current permissions:
FushiLockedHead=A Fushi capture component is in use by another program, so it cannot be updated:
FushiLockedBody=Fushi's voice capture component is injected into programs you choose (games, or any window you attached to) and stays loaded until that program exits. Close the program you attached to most recently (save your game first), then run this installer again.
FushiLockedNoChange=(No files were changed; your current version still works.)

